pect all CTD casts and quality codes","document":"research/aleutian-p14n-1993-hydrography-correspondence.json","pointer":"/casts"},{"label":"Inspect candidate timing and position offsets","document":"research/aleutian-p14n-1993-hydrography-correspondence.json","pointer":"/candidate_pairs"},{"label":"Inspect original CTD acquisition","document":"research/source-data/cchdo-p14n-1993/acquisition.json","pointer":""},{"label":"Inspect all observed profiles","document":"research/aleutian-p14n-1993-observed-vector-section.json","pointer":"/profiles"},{"label":"Inspect fixed branch windows and unresolved widths","document":"research/aleutian-p14n-1993-observed-vector-section.json","pointer":"/branches"},{"label":"Inspect sampling gaps, spacing and bearings","document":"research/aleutian-p14n-1993-observed-vector-section.json","pointer":"/track_legs"},{"label":"Inspect original archive acquisition","document":"research/source-data/jasadcp-p14n-1993/acquisition.json","pointer":""},{"label":"Inspect figure provenance","document":"research/source-data/jasadcp-p14n-1993/figure.json","pointer":""}],"original_url":"https://uhslc.soest.hawaii.edu/sadcp/DATABASE/00016.html","table":{"caption":"Hourly-track eastward-component spans in fixed search windows. Sensitivity is boundary choice, not a confidence interval or annual range.","headers":["Branch context","Search latitude","50% component span","40/50/60% envelope","Physical width"],"rows":[["Northern","44–46 N","≈100 km","90–110 km","Unknown"],["Southern","41–43 N","≈80 km","60–90 km","Unknown"]]},"additional_tables":[{"caption":"Native averaging support across the full 40–48 N reach. Counts are retained bins, not boundary support inside either branch. Every experiment has 6 relative-peak and 8 velocity-sensitivity cases across both branches; none resolve two crossings.","headers":["Minimum ship speed (m/s)","Window (minutes)","All retained bins","Bins with ≥80% coverage","Resolved boundary cases"],"rows":[["1.0","30","128","95","