ne-third-degree grid to0.1degrees adds no independent observation resolution.\",\n    \"The source half-year filter kernel, alignment, endpoint treatment and detailed weights remain unresolved.\",\n    \"Reading intervals reflect graphical/calibration/rounding allowance, not measurement uncertainty, confidence or annual physical variation.\",\n    \"Existing seasonal spatial profiles and218/207/210km prose means remain separate and unchanged; no new geographic edges or whole-current dimension.\"\n  ]\n}\n","document":{"schema":"osw.filtered-current-width-plot-time-series.v1","current_id":"kuroshio","status":"editorial_source_plot_readings_scientific_review_pending","source_url":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0967063711001968","source_citation":"Liu and Gan (2012), Variability of the Kuroshio in the East China Sea derived from satellite altimetry data, Deep-Sea Research I 59, 25-36, doi:10.1016/j.dsr.2011.10.008.","source_locator":"Figure7a and caption, printed page30/PDF6; section3.3 printed pages30–31; method section2.2.","input_sha256":{"research/source-data/kuroshio-liu-gan-2012/figure7a-time-extraction.json":"05a0be59242a846390472334c834c71b24cfc93302d82327d43933f3ee2a0729","plans/kuroshio-filtered-width-time-series-protocol-v1.md":"b9bc5e3480d3917de88df916c6a1d1325c8950a7f6c853505266f62c028b7910","research/kuroshio-liu-gan-2012-stream-mean-width-scope-audit.json":"607924d8b2f54393fcb150bd29b6e08f5abc99616e72b9142f879a17ded83fcd","research/source-data/kuroshio-liu-gan-2012/acquisition.json":"3c067c722f79ee4688de6adb176849587ce40e1612e4cd035ba4f2993eafac0d","research/source-data/kuroshio-liu-gan-2012/journal-article.pdf":"a452007ff7f3b0051f811ba8172e9ae7932642ed1916a29c779db6335772203b"},"config_file":"research/source-data/kuroshio-liu-gan-2012/figure7a-time-extraction.json","protocol_file":"plans/kuroshio-filtered-width-time-series-protocol-v1.md","generator_file":"analysis/build_kuroshio_filtered_width_series.py","generator_sha256":"7ae9485